# Frontend environment (all optional — defaults work in local dev via Vite proxy)
#
# In local dev the Vite proxy forwards /socket.io and /uploads to the backend,
# so you normally don't need to set anything here.
#
# For a PRODUCTION build served from a different origin than the backend,
# point the client at the backend's public URL:
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
